# Ack watermark operations
name: ack-watermark
version: 1
description: Ack watermark persists across reboot and cannot exceed last durable observation.

boot
read CHIP-001
read CHIP-002
read CHIP-003
assert ack_watermark 0
# Cannot ack beyond last observation
assert ready
fail_watermark_next
# set_ack_watermark should fail due to fail_watermark_next
# Note: set_ack_watermark is not directly exposed in scenario, so we can't test it here
# This is a placeholder for future extension
reboot
assert ack_watermark 0